  "id": "selection-research",
  "term": "selection research",
  "definition": "Selection research is the study of how hiring and employee-screening methods work, including tests and other assessment tools used to choose applicants. In this context, it examines whether these methods fairly measure job-relevant qualities or create systematic disadvantages for particular groups.",
